A transport drop can lose the response while the hub still commits this write; verify current hub state before retrying.[[FLAT_TRIM]] See hub_get_tool_guide(section='slow_ops').[[/FLAT_TRIM]]
""",
            inputSchema: [
                type: "object",
                properties: [
